import WethVerify.Weth.Gen
import TokenKit.Evm.Witness

/-!
# Sanity: every success path of WETH9 has a concrete run

Generated by `scripts/gen_sanity.py` from the success paths of `scripts/gen_paths.py` and the
argument words of the configuration (`sanity`); do not edit.

`<fn>_runs`: in the state with one account at the contract `C` and every slot 0, the call of
`<fn>` with the argument words below, from a caller whose address word is not 0, meets every
hypothesis of the success path theorem of `<fn>`; so there is a run from pc 0 that ends with no
error and with the stated output. No fact about keccak is used. `Witness.caller1_ne` gives one
such caller.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option maxRecDepth 4096

namespace WethVerify.Sanity

